te the installation steps.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                 =
                   &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=0A     =
                                                           &lt;/li&gt;=0A        =
                                                        &lt;li&gt;=0A            =
                                                        &lt;p&gt;Next, the Run di=
alogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                               =
                 &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                      =
              &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrint=
ers.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                           =
         &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                           =
     &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                              =
  &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                  =
  &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                               =
