u will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                               =
                                         printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                   =
                                             &lt;/li&gt;=0A                      =
                                          &lt;li&gt;=0A                          =
                                          &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printer to t=
he wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                =
                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                       =
             &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=0A   =
                                                                     driver=
.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;/l=
i&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=
